 page.reload();page.wait_for_selector('#playAdventure');page.click('#playAdventure');page.wait_for_function("state==='play'");page.wait_for_timeout(200);before=page.evaluate('terrainDistance');page.wait_for_timeout(250);assert page.evaluate('terrainDistance')>before
